I tracked this down to mgcv having two entries in the CRAN PACKAGES index, the additional one being for R 3.5 which specifies 1.8-22.
This entry and the difference in version is triggering a code path that has us building an incorrect download URL for the package, which is why this is failing.
I am trying to determine an appropriate work around or fix and will post an update when I know more.

