I have been able to fix this.  The issue appears to have been need to explicitly define the character encoding in the fromJSON and read.csv calls.  The reason it was confusing was that when I was re-deploying from RStudio, using replace of the existing instance, it wasn't working as I understood.   Deleting the instance and deploying fresh worked after the encoding code changes.

